{"id":696473,"title":"Best Value Whale Watching tour from Reykjavik","excerpt":"Set sail from Reykjavik's Old Harbour and embark on a thrilling whale watching adventure where the wild North Atlantic comes alive with giants of the deep!","description":"<p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Experience the best Iceland has to offer with spectacular <a href=\"https://reykjaviksailors.is/tours/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Whale Watching opportunities</strong></a>.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Our tours offer a unique experience and we do our best to make this a lifetime experience for you.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">A 3-3,5-hour Whale Watching adventure departing from Old harbour in downtown Reykjavik. We sail into Faxaflói bay in search of Minke and Humpback whales, Dolphins, Harbour porpoises and Killer whales (a rare sighting). On this tour, you will also experience the spectacular views of the mountains and islands around Reykjavik as well as the wonderful bird life. On board we have warm overalls, heated spacious indoor cabins, a nice bar and free WiFi.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><strong>NOTE: You should schedule to be at our departure point at least 30 minutes before scheduled departure.</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Please be aware that due to environmental reasons during certain times of the year our trips may be delivered on a shared boat with one of our partners. At Reykjavik Sailors, we are committed to ensuring the environment is kept pristine by making sure fewer boats are on the water. Looking for answers? Check our <a href=\"https://reykjaviksailors.is/faq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><strong>FAQ</strong></a>! </p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><br /></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Be prepared for the unpredictable nature of Whale Watching , subject to weather conditions.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">If cancelled, we offer refunds or rescheduling.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Discover new destinations and <a href=\"https://reykjaviksailors.is/blog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><strong>travel ideas</strong></a>!</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Please, check our <a href=\"https://reykjaviksailors.is/news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><strong>DAILY DIARY</strong></a> before you come for the tour. All the important daily information of all our tours will be notified on our website.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><strong>If you don&#39;t see a whale, you have the option to take the tour again for free.</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><br /></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Pickup services must be booked at least one hour before departure and are applicable to the first boat tour, with an additional fee for repeated tours.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Book <a href=\"https://reykjaviksailors.is/partner-tours/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><strong>top-rated tours</strong></a><strong> </strong>with our trusted partners!</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><br /></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><u><strong>ADDRESS</strong></u></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">We start at Geirsgata 11 (<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/y4CX8GtYj2d7hnXH6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/DatKA6eiZ5sXyxTW7</a>)</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Get there 30 minutes early to join the excitement.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">We’re just a message away—<a href=\"https://reykjaviksailors.is/about-us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><strong>contact us</strong></a>!</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb( 87 , 100 , 111 );margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">See you soon!</p>","vendor":"Reykjavik Sailors","durationText":"3 hours","photos":["https://imgcdn.bokun.tools/c99cad13-2a33-4fd2-b6b7-84bca9203398.jpeg?w=660&h=660","https://imgcdn.bokun.tools/8764b0f6-483f-401f-b449-c625ca8e53d7.jpeg?w=660&h=660","https://imgcdn.bokun.tools/dd7ad1fc-cc1a-4c65-89ba-9fc3b03d1e15.jpeg?w=660&h=660","https://imgcdn.bokun.tools/f5977510-b57b-40c7-a92a-68a81fd3a1e0.jpeg?w=660&h=660","https://imgcdn.bokun.tools/3e134a0b-833e-43ac-90e7-b0b53d650065.jpeg?w=660&h=660","https://imgcdn.bokun.tools/a2912187-7169-44a0-89ff-847febc6401e.jpeg?w=660&h=660","https://imgcdn.bokun.tools/de7f421e-27e6-425e-94e3-801ae4519553.jpeg?w=660&h=660","https://imgcdn.bokun.tools/c42a31ea-1e87-48a5-8fea-dfff422ad8a0.jpeg?w=660&h=660","https://imgc